---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions | MOUJA TAGHAZOUT"
  description="Terms and conditions for using the MOUJA TAGHAZOUT website and services. Bookings, payments, cancellations, liability and governing law."
  canonical="/terms"
  noindex
  bodyClass="page-legal"
  breadcrumb={['Terms']}
>
  <section class="detail-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <p>The rules for using our services.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow prose">
      <p>Last updated: June 19, 2024</p>

      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>Welcome to MOUJA TAGHAZOUT. These Terms and Conditions govern your use of our website and services. By accessing or using our services, you agree to be bound by these terms.</p>

      <h2>Bookings and Payments</h2>
      <p>All bookings are subject to availability. A deposit is required to secure your booking, with the final balance due upon arrival. We accept various payment methods, which will be detailed during the booking process.</p>

      <h2>Cancellations and Refunds</h2>
      <p>Cancellation policies vary depending on the package and time of year. Please refer to your booking confirmation for specific details. In general, deposits are non-refundable.</p>

      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>Surfing is an inherently risky activity. While we take all necessary precautions to ensure your safety, MOUJA TAGHAZOUT is not liable for any personal injury or loss/damage to personal property.</p>

      <h2>Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Morocco.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
